[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566243698","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100966#issuecomment-2566243698","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100966","id":2566243698,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Y9cVy","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-31T08:38:16Z","updated_at":"2024-12-31T08:38:16Z","body":"I think you're confusing the methods `InputEvent.is_action_pressed` (what you're using) with the one from `Input` singleton `Input.is_action_pressed`\n\nThis is the docs from `InputEvent`\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9342a1e7-f542-419d-9daa-56731821e8fd)\n\nThis is the docs from `Input`\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c1c15228-7e98-4c31-861e-800ad545a052)\n\n<br>\n\nLook how in the InputEvent docs says about the event don't be an echo event, an echo event is when a key was already pressed and the pressed event is emited again, that means the key was already pressed when the second event was emited. That explains why work for a time and stops after, because is the time between the first event and the second event.\n\nWhat you actually want to use is the `Input.is_action_pressed`, this one don't care about if is an echo event or not, just needs the correct key to be pressed.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566243698/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566276086","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100966#issuecomment-2566276086","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100966","id":2566276086,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Y9kP2","user":{"login":"RohitRao307","id":139103754,"node_id":"U_kgDOCEqOCg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139103754?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RohitRao307","html_url":"https://github.com/RohitRao307","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RohitRao307/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RohitRao307/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RohitRao307/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RohitRao307/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RohitRao307/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RohitRao307/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RohitRao307/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RohitRao307/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RohitRao307/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-31T09:21:52Z","updated_at":"2024-12-31T09:21:52Z","body":"ah, thanks, I didn't know what echo events meant. My bad\nI hadn't reached the part of 